OL,3,GNEWSABioethanol fire bought from TikTok
OL,4,Ashop exploded in mum's face
OL,5,
OL,6,FTikTok said they take the safety of
OL,7,Ftheir customers "extremely seriously"
OL,8,Fand the product in question was removed
OL,9,Ffrom sale earlier this year, with the
OL,10,Fseller no longer active on TikTok shop.
